title: AWS v2 EC2: Instance Network IO
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the number of bytes/packets received and transmitted on
 all network interfaces by the instance.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

item:
 Name of the instance

discovery:
 One service is created if all required metrics (NetworkIn, NetworkOut) are given.
